flowchart LR
  Commands[Drive commands] --> Physics[Drive physics]
  Physics --> Truth[Physical pose and motion]
  Truth --> Encoders[Simulated encoders and gyro]
  Encoders --> Odometry[Estimated pose]
  Truth --> Camera[Simulated localization observations]
  Camera --> Odometry
  Truth --> Fuel[Fuel contacts and launch]
  Fuel --> Detections[Simulated fuel detections]
  Detections --> Perception[AutoDrive perception]
